      "filename": "Lapworth Junction, Stratford-on-Avon Canal - geograph.org.uk - 1106813.jpg",
      "title": "File:Lapworth Junction, Stratford-on-Avon Canal - geograph.org.uk - 1106813.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6c/Lapworth_Junction%2C_Stratford-on-Avon_Canal_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1106813.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lapworth_Junction,_Stratford-on-Avon_Canal_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1106813.jpg",
